    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Praise for God’s Mighty Acts"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "For the choir director. A song. A psalm."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let the whole earth shout joyfully to God!"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Sing about the glory of his name;",
          "make his praise glorious."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Say to God, “How awe-inspiring are your works!",
          "Your enemies will cringe before you",
          "because of your great strength."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The whole earth will worship you",
          "and sing praise to you.",
          "They will sing praise to your name.”"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Come and see the wonders of God;",
          "his acts for humanity are awe-inspiring."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He turned the sea into dry land,",
          "and they crossed the river on foot.",
          "There we rejoiced in him."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He rules forever by his might;",
          "he keeps his eye on the nations.",
          "The rebellious should not exalt themselves."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Bless our God, you peoples;",
          "let the sound of his praise be heard."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He keeps us alive",
          "and does not allow our feet to slip."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For you, God, tested us;",
          "you refined us as silver is refined."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You lured us into a trap;",
          "you placed burdens on our backs."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          12
        ],
        "lines": [
          "You let men ride over our heads;",
          "we went through fire and water,",
          "but you brought us out to abundance. ,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          13
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will enter your house with burnt offerings;",
          "I will pay you my vows"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          14
        ],
        "lines": [
          "that my lips promised",
          "and my mouth spoke during my distress."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          15
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will offer you fattened sheep as burnt offerings,",
          "with the fragrant smoke of rams;",
          "I will sacrifice bulls with goats."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          16
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Come and listen, all who fear God,",
          "and I will tell what he has done for me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          17
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I cried out to him with my mouth,",
          "and praise was on my tongue."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          18
        ],
        "lines": [
          "If I had been aware of malice in my heart,",
          "the Lord would not have listened."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          19
        ],
        "lines": [
          "However, God has listened;",
          "he has paid attention to the sound of my prayer."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          20
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Blessed be God!",
          "He has not turned away my prayer",
          "or turned his faithful love from me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
